sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Frontend UI
    participant ProjectAPI as Project API
    participant LangChain as LangChain Orchestrator
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant DB as Database

    User->>UI: Enter project requirements
    UI->>ProjectAPI: POST /api/projects
    ProjectAPI->>DB: Create new project record
    DB-->>ProjectAPI: Return project ID
    ProjectAPI->>LangChain: Generate initial system designs
    LangChain->>LLM: Send formatted prompts
    LLM-->>LangChain: Return generated designs
    LangChain->>DB: Store generated design assets
    ProjectAPI-->>UI: Return project with initial assets
    UI->>UI: Display initial system context diagram
    UI-->>User: Notify creation complete
